===Verb===
{{non-verb}}

# to [[dig]]
# to [[bury]]
# to [[engrave]]
# to [[enquire]] (also in middle voice: [[grafask]])
# {{context|impersonal|lang=is}} to cause the formation of [[pus]] (in something); [[suppurate]]

